  "content": "\n\n<p>Elytra Slot 是一個使用 Curios API／Trinkets API 的模組，為玩家物品欄新增一個鞘翅槽位，並允許將鞘翅放入該槽位。當鞘翅位於此槽位時，它將提供與裝備在胸甲槽位相同的飛行能力。這讓玩家能夠享受鞘翅的好處，而不必犧牲任何一個護甲槽位。</p>\n<h3>Forge 相依套件</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caelus</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Fabric 相依套件</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trinkets</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Curios</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gFyQBPW.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><strong>Trinkets</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FVV3gSp/elytratrinket.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>下載</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elytra-slot-fabric/files/all\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric 1.16.1 - 1.19.2</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elytra-slot/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric 1.19.3+</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elytra-slot/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elytra-slot/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:9153\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Quilt</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>支援</h2>\n<p>請向 <a href=\"https://github.com/illusivesoulworks/elytraslot/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤器</a> 回報所有錯誤、問題與功能請求。</p>\n<p>如需非技術性支援或提問，請加入開發者的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/JWgrdwt\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>。</p>\n<h2>授權條款</h2>\n<p>所有原始碼與素材均採用 LGPL-3.0-or-later 授權。</p>\n<h2>贊助</h2>\n<p>若要贊助開發者，可透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fC0C1NL4O\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a> 進行。</p>\n<h2>合作夥伴</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fillusive\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/1G4QPdc/bh-illusive.png\" alt=\"BisectHosting\"></a></p>",
